    "identifier": "nobunagas-rage",
    "description": "<p>Your eyes glaze over with a wrathful roar. All hostile creatures within range must make a Wisdom saving throw to avoid being taunted by your aggressive demeaner. On a failed save, until the end of their next turn, they must target you with their offensive attacks of jutsu.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: A creature who fails their saving throw is also Demoralized.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the radius by +5 feet.</p>",
